$DIR/test.p:33:16: cannot use f (variable of union type Figure) as Shape value in variable declaration
    s is declared as Shape, so it can only hold values of that type; f is a
    Figure. Plutonium, like Go, does not convert between different types
    automatically.
    (see "Assignability" in the Plutonium spec, section 8.4)
    (run "pluto explain E0023" for a longer explanation)

